{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/020-beefy-curly-side-table/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"73f4b934-f8db-509b-b4a7-657f7aac59c5","excerpt":"The corner by the couch needed a side table - somewhere to set a drink, hold a plant, maybe stack a few books. I had some spectacular curly maple that had been…","html":"<p>The corner by the couch needed a side table - somewhere to set a drink, hold a plant, maybe stack a few books. I had some spectacular curly maple that had been waiting for the right project.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/669cd/living_room_before.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Living Room Before\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/f058b/living_room_before.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/c26ae/living_room_before.png 158w,\n/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/6bdcf/living_room_before.png 315w,\n/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/f058b/living_room_before.png 630w,\n/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/40601/living_room_before.png 945w,\n/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/78612/living_room_before.png 1260w,\n/static/3171a96dd25574880c7a31dae2305147/669cd/living_room_before.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The empty corner next to the couch was prime real estate for a side table. The existing furniture had clean lines and a modern feel, so the table needed to complement that aesthetic.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/493ac/glue_up.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Glue Up\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/f058b/glue_up.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/c26ae/glue_up.png 158w,\n/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/6bdcf/glue_up.png 315w,\n/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/f058b/glue_up.png 630w,\n/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/40601/glue_up.png 945w,\n/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/78612/glue_up.png 1260w,\n/static/fc5d0b6b8116ebab447855901cf3e929/493ac/glue_up.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The curly maple during glue-up showed off its chatoyance - that shimmer that changes as you move around the wood. This figure is what makes curly maple so prized.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/493ac/curly_top.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Curly Top\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/f058b/curly_top.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/c26ae/curly_top.png 158w,\n/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/6bdcf/curly_top.png 315w,\n/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/f058b/curly_top.png 630w,\n/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/40601/curly_top.png 945w,\n/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/78612/curly_top.png 1260w,\n/static/44ed2b1e72cb9bfad628cb609d7d5ba5/493ac/curly_top.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Three boards joined for the tabletop, the curl running consistently across the full width. The thick stock gave the piece its “beefy” name - this wasn’t going to be some delicate accent piece.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/669cd/finished_outside.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Finished Outside\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/f058b/finished_outside.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/c26ae/finished_outside.png 158w,\n/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/6bdcf/finished_outside.png 315w,\n/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/f058b/finished_outside.png 630w,\n/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/40601/finished_outside.png 945w,\n/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/78612/finished_outside.png 1260w,\n/static/4a8290d0306ad6f9f5fe7d86d825a042/669cd/finished_outside.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The finished table with black ink poly legs providing contrast to the light maple. Three tiers meant plenty of storage while maintaining visual openness. The industrial-modern mix worked well.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/493ac/in_place.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"In Place\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/f058b/in_place.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/c26ae/in_place.png 158w,\n/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/6bdcf/in_place.png 315w,\n/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/f058b/in_place.png 630w,\n/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/40601/in_place.png 945w,\n/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/78612/in_place.png 1260w,\n/static/9857d57b4eb07f32dc1bf65d148d9f24/493ac/in_place.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>In its new home, the table does exactly what it should - holds a plant, catches the light beautifully, and anchors the corner of the room. The curly maple earns compliments from everyone who notices it.</p>\n<p>Building furniture for your own home hits different. Every time you walk past it, you remember the process - picking the wood, the glue-up, seeing it all come together. That connection never fades.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Beefy Curly Side Table","date":"May 13, 2019","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/019-3d-camera-handle/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"3D Camera Handle"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/022-more-adirondacks/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"More Adirondacks"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"73f4b934-f8db-509b-b4a7-657f7aac59c5","previousPostId":"e65bbb29-6bee-5ec4-8f54-5f33b092fffb","nextPostId":"8c09a396-28c8-5740-be2e-20fee06a2277"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}